  "question": {
    "text": "Let the number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>22</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>2022</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2022</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>22</mn></msup></math> leave the remainder <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></math> when divided by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></math> when divided by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to",
